Dear  Fiersteity,

Thank you for your email.

Please note that abuse@ripe.net is not monitored.
The RIPE NCC does not investigate abuse reports concerning our members. I=
f you're trying to report network abuse (such as spam, hacking or other n=
etwork misuse), please send it to the organisation that manages the IP ad=
dress the abuse is coming from.

To do this, follow these steps:
1. Go to RIPEstat: https://stat.ripe.net
2. Enter the IP address

You will find the abuse contact for the responsible IP network.

Please note that the contact listed may not the abuser, it's the network =
operator responsible for handling abuse reports.

Thank you for your understanding.

